# Case of the Burning Masks: "To solve - Three or more sources you controlled dealt damage this turn" and "Solved - Sacrifice this Case: Exile the top three cards of your library. Choose one of them.
# You may play that card this turn." (CR 719.3a, 702.169d, 406, 305.1) On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Case (its enters trigger is the first source, killing Bot2's Memnite) and Lightning Bolts Bot2 twice
# (the second and third): three sources, so the Case is solved at the beginning of the end step, and until then its sacrifice ability cannot be activated. On turn 5 the sacrifice exiles Bot1's top three
# cards - Bot2's library is untouched - and the Island chosen is played as the land drop; the Memnite and Lightning Bolt left in exile cannot be played.

